@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+# Dune Sentinel
+
+UE 5.7. Version 1.0.0; commit `f501f7434a62c80e20c16c078f2420938da985fc`.
+
+## Requirements
+
+Windows 10/11, a DirectX 12 GPU, Unreal Engine 5.7 and its supported C++ toolchain. Git LFS and Python 3.11+ are required to restore and replay the project.
+
+## Package contents
+
+The delivery includes the brief, design, actual creation records, replay, reference media and integrity manifest.
+The full archive additionally contains UEProject/, Build/, History/ and separate task/grader documents.
+
+## Play the game
+
+Run Build/DuneSentinel.exe from the full archive. Enter starts flight; W accelerates, S brakes, A/D roll, Down/Up pitch and Q/E yaw. Tab selects a target, F tracks it, LeftControl fires the cannon and SpaceBar launches a missile.
+
+## Replay the creation process
+
+The verified replay reproduces this iteration's recorded adoption and organization of existing UE 5.7 assets. These adoption operations are not represented as new native authoring. Follow ReplayScripts/README.md; its verification report records the actual scope and result.
+
+## Restore the git history
+
+The repository itself is the history. The full archive additionally contains an anonymized bundle and its LFS objects.
+
+## Tasks
+
+The full archive provides task.json and grader.json separately under Tasks/<name>/. Only the task document and the start snapshot are supplied to the agent. This repository mirror omits those documents.
+
+## Scenarios
+
+The videos are retained reference media with unchanged bytes. They were not newly captured from this release.
+
+- [Glass Horizon - Airfield Defense](Gameplay/dune-sentinel_S1.mp4): retained reference video, 62.984 seconds.
+
+## Screenshots
+
+These images are also retained reference media.
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_02.jpg)
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_03.jpg)
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_04.jpg)
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_05.jpg)
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_06.jpg)
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_07.jpg)
+
+![Reference gameplay image](Screenshots/dune-sentinel_S1_20261016-025526_s42_08.jpg)
+
+## Assets and licences
+
+The project assets.manifest.json and Docs/ThirdPartyNotices.md retain asset origins and licences.
+
+## Integrity
+
+manifest.json lists file sizes and SHA256 digests. History LFS objects are content-addressed and counted separately.
