+GIT-LOG 1
+# Project DuneSentinel (dune-sentinel): the git history up to commit f501f7434a62c80e20c16c078f2420938da985fc, oldest first (History/ holds every commit).
+# Recorded as it happened (not reconstructed). Authors and committers are anonymised as dev_NN.
+# Text changes are full unified diffs; binary files and Git LFS files are given as path + sha256 + bytes (old -> new).
